  "body": "I am working on rolling our the COEP by evaluating violations and enabling CORP headers for the resources. However, violations that result from http request failures and missing CORP headers cannot be filtered based on current violation reporting syntax.\r\n\r\nThis request is to add 'status-code' reporting as part of the browser reporting syntax similar to the CSP (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/CSP#violation_report_syntax).\r\n\r\nSimilar Reference Post: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/5391",
